<view class="page {{themeClass}}"><view class="title">核对旧服务赠卡</view><view class="hint">仅承接独立赠送、无现金余额、一次服务扣一次的赠卡。付费及混合卡继续待核对。</view><view wx:if="{{receipt}}" class="receipt">{{receipt}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重新读取</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}">读取中…</view><block wx:if="{{info && !loading}}"><view class="card"><view>{{info.sourceTitle}} · 原始资料</view><text class="raw" selectable>{{sourceText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{info.grant}}" class="card">{{info.grant.kind==='service'?'已启用为服务赠卡':'此来源已启用为实物，不可重复转卡'}}<view wx:if="{{info.grant.kind==='service'}}">剩余 {{info.grant.remaining}} 次 · {{info.grant.expiresOn || '无期限'}}。核销请进入服务结算，退回必须关联原服务单。</view></view><view wx:else class="card"><label>赠卡名称</label><input value="{{title}}" data-key="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="120"/><label>指定服务</label><picker range="{{services}}" range-key="nameZh" value="{{serviceIndex}}" bindchange="selectService"><view class="input">{{services[serviceIndex].nameZh}}</view></picker><label>核对剩余次数（整数，耗尽填 0）</label><input type="number" value="{{quantity}}" data-key="quantity" bindinput="input"/><label>单次参考价值（本店币种，不是可退本金）</label><input type="digit" value="{{unitValue}}" data-key="unitValue" bindinput="input"/><label>到期日期</label><picker mode="date" value="{{expiresOn}}" data-key="expiresOn" bindchange="input"><view class="input">{{expiresOn || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><button wx:if="{{expiresOn}}" bindtap="clearExpiry">清空日期</button><button class="check" data-key="noExpiry" bindtap="check"><text class="check-box">{{agreements.noExpiry?'✓':''}}</text>原权益明确无期限</button><button class="check" data-key="serviceGiftConfirmed" bindtap="check"><text class="check-box">{{agreements.serviceGiftConfirmed?'✓':''}}</text>确认是独立赠送的服务权益</button><button class="check" data-key="noCashBalance" bindtap="check"><text class="check-box">{{agreements.noCashBalance?'✓':''}}</text>无付费本金或储值余额，没有重复启用</button><button class="check" data-key="oneUsePerService" bindtap="check"><text class="check-box">{{agreements.oneUsePerService?'✓':''}}</text>每次指定服务扣一次，无其他限制</button><button class="check" data-key="rulesConfirmed" bindtap="check"><text class="check-box">{{agreements.rulesConfirmed?'✓':''}}</text>项目、次数和期限已核对</button><button class="check" data-key="sourceUseStopped" bindtap="check"><text class="check-box">{{agreements.sourceUseStopped?'✓':''}}</text>截止后的使用已核对，原系统不再重复核销</button><label>核对依据及次数差异原因</label><textarea value="{{reason}}" data-key="reason" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000"/><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{saving}}">{{saving?'处理中…':'确认启用，不立即核销'}}</button></view></block></view>